# Gated DeltaNet-2 1.3B (NVIDIA, 2026), the paper's hybrid: 9 Gated DeltaNet-2 layers,
# each followed by a sliding-window attention layer, every mixer by a SwiGLU MLP. The
# attention has 18 heads of 128 with RoPE, each query seeing itself and the 2047 keys
# before it. 1.30B parameters besides the embedding and the head, as the paper's code
# counts them. The paper's recurrent-only model is "N"^18 with MLPs of 6208.
d_model    = 2304
vocab_size = 32000

norm = rmsnorm(eps=1e-5)
gdn2 = gdn2(num_heads=16, head_dim=128)
swa  = gqa(num_heads=18, num_kv_heads=18, sliding_window_size=2048, rope=rope())
ffn  = gated_mlp(intermediate_size=6784, activation=swish)

layer(mixer) = [norm mixer] [norm ffn]
N = layer(gdn2)
S = layer(swa)

model = embed "NS"^9 norm head
